+# The org.mate.randr.policy POLKIT POLICY is not built: polkit is not packaged for
+# Gloire (no recipe), NO built package ships anything under /usr/share/polkit-1/actions,
+# and this same file is why capplets/system-info and capplets/time-admin are disabled
+# above. Note the build cannot produce it here in any case -- `msgfmt --xml` locates the
+# translatable attributes through polkit's OWN /usr/share/gettext/its/polkit.its, which
+# is absent from the build image, and upstream's autotools build uses the identical
+# `msgfmt --xml --template` rule (capplets/display/Makefile.am:40), so this is not a
+# meson-vs-autotools difference. mate-display-properties-install-systemwide itself still
+# builds and ships; only its pkexec authorisation file is gone.
